      "lines": [
        "9. 气体、液体和固体的结构"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分子运动论可以说明为什么物质可以处于气态、液态和",
        "固态。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气体　在气体中，原子或分子之间的距离，平均比分子本",
        "身大小要大许多倍（图 $6$）。例如，在 $1$ 个大气压下，容器的体",
        "积是其中气体分子总体积的几万倍。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 6",
      "box": [
        191,
        744,
        497,
        496
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-06"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 6",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 7",
      "box": [
        744,
        828,
        570,
        414
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-07"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 7",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气体很容易被压缩，因为压缩气体时，减小的只是分子间",
        "的平均距离，而分子并没有彼此“挤压”（图 $7$）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分子以巨大的速度——几百米每秒——在空间运动。碰",
        "撞时，它们象台球一样，分别向不同方向弹回。气体分子运动",
        "得越快，它的温度越高。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气体分子的吸引力很小，不能使它们一个挨着一个。因",
        "此，气体可以无限地膨胀。它们没有一定的形状和体积。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "大量分子对容器壁的多次碰撞，产生了气体的压强。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "液体　在液体中，分子几乎是一个挨着一个地排列"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
